{
  "notes": [
    "Flip gate for the native walk's planning (Rust-exit gap wave 1 lane 11,",
    "#1509 parts 3b-5): the instances an entry or library compile defines",
    "(`instances_for_roots`), their internal conventions (`NativeAbi::plan`)",
    "and their entry blocks (`frame_plan`), ported as @vesper/native-walk",
    "(packages/vesper-codegen-walk) and installed as the hybrid's",
    "`entry_plans` and `export_plans` hooks. A compiler module: its Rust",
    "(src/native.rs, src/native_export.rs) is deleted by the Rust compiler's",
    "retirement (SH6 lane 2), not by this flip.",
    "Differential: every entry compile of the corpus and the test sources,",
    "the Beacon trace hosts and the sampled library objects, CLIF and object",
    "bytes with the package against without it.",
    "ABBA: the same compiles end to end (lowering, optimizer, walk and",
    "Cranelift), the hook's encoding and decoding included."
  ],
  "name": "native-walk",
  "lane": "G1-11",
  "rust": ["src/native.rs", "src/native_export.rs"],
  "env": {
    "CARGO_PROFILE_DEV_DEBUG": "0",
    "CARGO_PROFILE_TEST_DEBUG": "0",
    "CARGO_PROFILE_RELEASE_DEBUG": "0"
  },
  "build": [
    ["cargo", "test", "--locked", "--release", "--test", "self_host_native_walk_frame", "--no-run"]
  ],
  "tests": [
    {
      "run": ["cargo", "test", "--locked", "--release", "--test", "self_host_native_walk_frame", "frame_plan"]
    }
  ],
  "differential": {
    "run": {
      "sequence": [
        ["cargo", "test", "--locked", "--release", "--test", "self_host_native_walk_frame", "the_entry_plans_swap_matches_rust", "--", "--exact", "--nocapture"],
        ["cargo", "test", "--locked", "--release", "--test", "self_host_native_walk_frame", "the_entry_plans_swap_matches_rust_on_trace_hosts", "--", "--nocapture"],
        ["cargo", "test", "--locked", "--release", "--test", "self_host_native_walk_frame", "the_export_plans_swap_matches_rust", "--", "--nocapture"]
      ]
    }
  },
  "abba": [
    {
      "workload": "entries",
      "run": {
        "argv": ["cargo", "test", "--locked", "--release", "--test", "self_host_native_walk_frame", "flip_gate", "--", "--nocapture"],
        "env": {
          "NATIVE_WALK_GATE_WORKLOAD": "entries",
          "CHECK_HARNESS_SPEED": "1"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "workload": "exports",
      "run": {
        "argv": ["cargo", "test", "--locked", "--release", "--test", "self_host_native_walk_frame", "flip_gate", "--", "--nocapture"],
        "env": {
          "NATIVE_WALK_GATE_WORKLOAD": "exports",
          "CHECK_HARNESS_SPEED": "1"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
